# Mapbox. On Vercel the token comes from the shared variable MapBoxBluePurple;
# locally, set any one of the names below.
#
# vite.config.ts resolves these and injects them at build time, because Vite
# only exposes VITE_-prefixed variables to client code and the Vercel shared
# variable isn't one. Values are sorted by shape, so it doesn't matter which
# name holds which: pk.… is treated as a token, mapbox://… as a style.
#
# The token ends up in the JS bundle either way, as it must for a browser map.
# Keeping it out of source only stops it being scraped from the public repo —
# what protects it is a URL restriction set on the token in the Mapbox account.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=

# Optional. Defaults to the project's custom style
# (mapbox://styles/argtlsj85/cmjesqgz3001y01s1gx990dix).
# VITE_MAPBOX_STYLE=
